{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s001", "text": "你好，今天的会议改到下午3点半开始。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.493, "n_samples": 83837, "proc_s": 1.1142, "rtf": 0.319, "samples_sha256": "504125fd7b17ce8b8820f73d9b14a83f178b25198821868f7196c596d7545f25"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s002", "text": "我刚买了一部新的iPhone，用起来很顺手。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.883, "n_samples": 93183, "proc_s": 1.4085, "rtf": 0.3628, "samples_sha256": "1f4768d32834f876b7808de4041e9527d78faa70dc760e7977dc52df074fbe99"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s003", "text": "这件衣服打折以后只要128元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.032, "n_samples": 72764, "proc_s": 0.913, "rtf": 0.3011, "samples_sha256": "48bbf34375b36a63b9210cdeb59cd60e3e03a4c9e8e77e6e8c22302d53c62ca2"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s004", "text": "我们约在2026年10月20日见面吧。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.138, "n_samples": 75300, "proc_s": 0.9104, "rtf": 0.2902, "samples_sha256": "c2794a97ac6b924e7c5f692a3ff66bad80876905d8f5ecbb78e7dcbb52074755"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s005", "text": "请把报告在周五之前发给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.542, "n_samples": 61002, "proc_s": 0.8564, "rtf": 0.3369, "samples_sha256": "0668641acce229c69e8658942f1687dbd139ed79a1e1d792d9126ad5839d9ba6"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s006", "text": "现在的AI工具越来越好用了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.001, "n_samples": 72015, "proc_s": 1.2685, "rtf": 0.4228, "samples_sha256": "83d3e8bf0843c2025e80de247e82d7f80af7aba8b7995c4610fe714db83ed0bd"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s007", "text": "你的航班几点起飞？我记得是早上8点20分。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.254, "n_samples": 102085, "proc_s": 1.3134, "rtf": 0.3088, "samples_sha256": "f780fabd2a5633f44da25896e919f06dc2a1b355d59235cde50afb7a8f7175e1"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s008", "text": "这个月的电费一共是356块钱。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.208, "n_samples": 77003, "proc_s": 0.9308, "rtf": 0.2901, "samples_sha256": "ee433bcdf628898f5699cc5c0a97fc9dc93d000dd39c0bfcfc23f3dc790b9a2d"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s009", "text": "我住在3楼，电梯就在门口右边。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.212, "n_samples": 77099, "proc_s": 1.1733, "rtf": 0.3652, "samples_sha256": "d1dec02008c75188e03c312713bd9bec90030cdbd8238b6a57bc4bdfbde904bd"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s010", "text": "他每天跑步5公里，已经坚持了两年。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.531, "n_samples": 84738, "proc_s": 1.2589, "rtf": 0.3565, "samples_sha256": "8f43403674ae9d236c0b45e61faa0f34d5865a10a04e9b562a2cac72a26b0113"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s011", "text": "下周一我们要去上海出差。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.395, "n_samples": 57471, "proc_s": 0.782, "rtf": 0.3266, "samples_sha256": "ce9da3074436e1febc6767ec323150aeb507c6c0b0e20f417d4153db6ee8203a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s012", "text": "你能帮我订一张明天去北京的高铁票吗？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.413, "n_samples": 81924, "proc_s": 1.0458, "rtf": 0.3064, "samples_sha256": "0603ab4068ea8f22081dac8077652ef1e7db45a3b58d9f57fe4f1b526bc9b56f"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s013", "text": "这家餐厅的评分是4.8分，值得一试。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.768, "n_samples": 90427, "proc_s": 1.2545, "rtf": 0.3329, "samples_sha256": "40b749a8a05931dcbb76fb507a5186634582855796c46495fcef3a5212777cf9"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s014", "text": "我的手机号是13812345678，有事打给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.538, "n_samples": 108911, "proc_s": 1.4379, "rtf": 0.3169, "samples_sha256": "b716b88a7845de678a4b3a0b6343d94a5091ceb879f2e20cdf243915496fc61b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s015", "text": "今年公司的销售额增长了15%。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.138, "n_samples": 75306, "proc_s": 0.9842, "rtf": 0.3137, "samples_sha256": "cf0fc02d96799c90ba6e8f3d9cbc29c36c740a51f930809ff7f0b32f8f6c53a3"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s016", "text": "孩子们放学以后在公园里踢足球。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.945, "n_samples": 70686, "proc_s": 0.8299, "rtf": 0.2818, "samples_sha256": "8b8519cc6acb354f4235eb35b52326a473f4883721ebd89a31b8c580f8b7fc59"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s017", "text": "我用微信给你转了2000块，记得查收。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.454, "n_samples": 82908, "proc_s": 1.1305, "rtf": 0.3272, "samples_sha256": "21ffbe509df08df1e59e9376cdae6e056a18866ffb5a649045646b29bffd9452"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s018", "text": "天气预报说明天最高气温32度。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.001, "n_samples": 72029, "proc_s": 0.8446, "rtf": 0.2814, "samples_sha256": "707688193ee81a035cb99aa398369573ce3e24a4d343e929097a32ee8b7dc613"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s019", "text": "请问洗手间在哪里？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 1.94, "n_samples": 46550, "proc_s": 0.6453, "rtf": 0.3327, "samples_sha256": "7b3de4dec4afd13e6e9385263c184150aedf48a39a77dcebda7c12e5be7bed59"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s020", "text": "我们的Zoom会议链接已经发到群里了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.469, "n_samples": 83260, "proc_s": 1.1457, "rtf": 0.3302, "samples_sha256": "4583c10edef5fa9a5321e187615016bb020b40c3052ea2c81b96c850fae8eb26"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s021", "text": "这本书我看了一半，故事特别精彩。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.269, "n_samples": 78453, "proc_s": 1.1043, "rtf": 0.3378, "samples_sha256": "281bb3d768a867f39a84055d44c1041baa447ad8590d6c4b7f2f6b0b3961167e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s022", "text": "他的生日是5月4日，我们准备给他一个惊喜。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.987, "n_samples": 95678, "proc_s": 1.2771, "rtf": 0.3203, "samples_sha256": "bd56beb02a4c1dede89bf85a85f343b460f57f1eaa2db6e4d025c5a4496685fb"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s023", "text": "从这里打车到机场大概需要40分钟。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.39, "n_samples": 81368, "proc_s": 0.9339, "rtf": 0.2755, "samples_sha256": "57d48e80fa21f199c2fce0212bdd54b0cc2cb6603676b76853e1ad1ee8124e9c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s024", "text": "我刚下载了ChatGPT的新版本。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.856, "n_samples": 92553, "proc_s": 1.4837, "rtf": 0.3847, "samples_sha256": "68413ae6dd76bb08d900bfeb46e158070c1b28ba6af2bc2e7d513e5afbff99ba"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s025", "text": "房租每个月涨了500元，真让人头疼。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.547, "n_samples": 85139, "proc_s": 1.2441, "rtf": 0.3507, "samples_sha256": "024717ef3eacae8af26b1d7fe7bab77944a3b6aca1ccba88b44cd90ba54d4d3d"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s026", "text": "周末你想去看电影还是去爬山？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.768, "n_samples": 66432, "proc_s": 0.7991, "rtf": 0.2887, "samples_sha256": "fe9ef09aeca8b242d4cec6ad6780b872bc1a403a24d0247c2f83ea88957abe4a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid46", "sentence_id": "s027", "text": "这台笔记本电脑的价格是6999元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.775, "n_samples": 90605, "proc_s": 1.0258, "rtf": 0.2717, "samples_sha256": "79d6f1a3bb089ceb31b14c589632a87bfa4f3c01e68ecf317ed22facb3281f1d"}
